  "description": "Ji-Han has spent a lifetime adhering to the rules in a bid to win the approval of his parents and peers. But he never receives true affection until he meets a boy by the name of Joon-Hyuk injured on the street. Against all expectations otherwise, Ji-Han takes Joon-Hyuk in as his roommate. But little does Ji-Han know that this chance encounter will change his entire life...\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes 4 extra chapters.*",
